ShortDescription: On-demand WireGuard VPN for the terminal (client and self-hosted server).
Description: |-
  tvpn is a single native binary that connects to any WireGuard server from cmd,
  PowerShell or Windows Terminal (`tvpn up`), shows live status, and disconnects
  cleanly with Ctrl+C. It can also run your own WireGuard server and generate
  client configs (with QR codes for the mobile apps). Requires an administrator
  terminal to create the tunnel adapter.
